    "detailed_description": "Play as the protagonist &quot;BlazingAngel Mistletear&quot; to defeat enemies and head out to rescue your younger sister in this side scroll action game.<br><br><strong>[Features]</strong><br>- Contains subtitles translated by native English/Chinese translators<br>- Fully voiced female characters (Japanese)<br>- Save/load and message skip/fast-forward functions<br>- Change between a retro pixel display or a hi-res 3D display<br>- Adjustable difficulty settings<br>- 1366x768 screen size / full-screen compatible<br>- Key control and gamepad input setting functions available.<br>- Game resolution adjustable<br><br><strong>[Story]</strong><br>The two sisters Kaede and Aki were suddenly kidnapped by an unknown enemy, and when Aki awoke, her body had been modified by a mysterious secret society.<br><br>To save her younger sister Kaede, Aki decides to use her newfound superhuman powers<br>and fight enemies by transforming into the \u201cBlazingAngel Mistletear\u201d!<br><br><br>Work to meet various requirements in the mission mode, and earn points to power-up the heroine in the training mode! Use various combos and attacks to beat up enemies and complete 7 stages!<br><br>Various enemies obstruct her righteous path, from various modified human type enemies: tentacle and slime monsters, clone soldiers, female soldiers, and even ordinary citizens! They will restrain the heroine mid-battle to assault her body in unique ways!<br><br>Adjust the game's difficulty to your liking! This game can be also be enjoyed by those who are not familiar with action games! <br><br>Change between a retro pixel display or a delicate hi-res 3D display. Enjoy the game at your preferred resolution. <br><br>Playable with gamepads, mouse, and keyboards!",
    "about_the_game": "Play as the protagonist &quot;BlazingAngel Mistletear&quot; to defeat enemies and head out to rescue your younger sister in this side scroll action game.<br><br><strong>[Features]</strong><br>- Contains subtitles translated by native English/Chinese translators<br>- Fully voiced female characters (Japanese)<br>- Save/load and message skip/fast-forward functions<br>- Change between a retro pixel display or a hi-res 3D display<br>- Adjustable difficulty settings<br>- 1366x768 screen size / full-screen compatible<br>- Key control and gamepad input setting functions available.<br>- Game resolution adjustable<br><br><strong>[Story]</strong><br>The two sisters Kaede and Aki were suddenly kidnapped by an unknown enemy, and when Aki awoke, her body had been modified by a mysterious secret society.<br><br>To save her younger sister Kaede, Aki decides to use her newfound superhuman powers<br>and fight enemies by transforming into the \u201cBlazingAngel Mistletear\u201d!<br><br><br>Work to meet various requirements in the mission mode, and earn points to power-up the heroine in the training mode! Use various combos and attacks to beat up enemies and complete 7 stages!<br><br>Various enemies obstruct her righteous path, from various modified human type enemies: tentacle and slime monsters, clone soldiers, female soldiers, and even ordinary citizens! They will restrain the heroine mid-battle to assault her body in unique ways!<br><br>Adjust the game's difficulty to your liking! This game can be also be enjoyed by those who are not familiar with action games! <br><br>Change between a retro pixel display or a delicate hi-res 3D display. Enjoy the game at your preferred resolution. <br><br>Playable with gamepads, mouse, and keyboards!",
    "short_description": "Become a transforming heroine and use various attacks and sweet combos to defeat enemies and monsters, and save your younger sister in this side-scrolling action game!",
